import{_ as a,o as n,c as i,a as l}from"./app.DkoUFz-u.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"","description":"","frontmatter":{},"headers":[],"relativePath":"backend/security/https/certificates.md","filePath":"backend/security/https/certificates.md"}'),t={name:"backend/security/https/certificates.md"};function p(e,s,_,c,o,h){return n(),i("div",null,[...s[0]||(s[0]=[l(`<p>这里有一份关于“网络安全-HTTP/SSL-证书管理”的学习笔记，它梳理了从基础概念到实际操作的关键知识点，希望能帮助你系统性地理解和掌握这部分内容。</p><blockquote><p><strong>知识要点</strong>：这份笔记内容综合自网络技术文档和开发者社区，虽然多为2024年至2025年的较新资料，具有一定参考价值，但部分细节（如命令和配置）仍需以官方文档为准。</p></blockquote><h2 id="🔍-1-https与ssl-tls基础" tabindex="-1">🔍 1 HTTPS与SSL/TLS基础 <a class="header-anchor" href="#🔍-1-https与ssl-tls基础" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;🔍 1 HTTPS与SSL/TLS基础&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-为什么需要https" tabindex="-1">1.1 为什么需要HTTPS <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-为什么需要https" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 为什么需要HTTPS&quot;">​</a></h3><p>HTTP协议是明文传输的，存在<strong>窃听</strong>、<strong>篡改</strong>和<strong>冒充</strong>的风险。HTTPS通过引入SSL/TLS层解决了这些问题，确保数据传输的<strong>保密性</strong>、<strong>完整性</strong>和<strong>身份认证</strong>。</p><h3 id="_1-2-ssl-tls核心概念" tabindex="-1">1.2 SSL/TLS核心概念 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-ssl-tls核心概念" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 SSL/TLS核心概念&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li><strong>非对称加密</strong>：用于初始握手阶段。通信双方各有一对<strong>公钥</strong>和<strong>私钥</strong>。公钥公开，私钥保密。用公钥加密的数据只有对应的私钥才能解密。</li><li><strong>对称加密</strong>：用于握手后的数据传输阶段。双方使用相同的密钥进行加解密，效率高于非对称加密。</li><li><strong>数字证书</strong>：由<strong>证书颁发机构（CA）</strong> 签发，相当于服务器的&quot;数字身份证&quot;。它绑定了服务器的公钥和身份信息（如域名），并由CA进行数字签名，以防伪造。</li><li><strong>数字签名</strong>：CA使用其私钥对证书信息的哈希值进行加密，生成数字签名。客户端用CA的公钥验证签名，以此判断证书是否被篡改。</li></ul><h2 id="🔄-2-ssl-tls握手过程" tabindex="-1">🔄 2 SSL/TLS握手过程 <a class="header-anchor" href="#🔄-2-ssl-tls握手过程" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;🔄 2 SSL/TLS握手过程&quot;">​</a></h2><p>SSL/TLS握手是为了安全地协商出一份对称加密的秘钥。其核心流程，以单向认证（客户端验证服务器）为例，可以概括如下：</p><div class="language-mermaid vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">mermaid</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">sequenceDiagram</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    participant C as 客户端</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    participant S as 服务器</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    Note over C,S: TLS握手开始</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    C-&gt;&gt;S: 1. Client Hello: 支持的TLS版本、加密套件、随机数</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    S-&gt;&gt;C: 2. Server Hello: 确定的TLS版本、加密套件、随机数</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    S-&gt;&gt;C: 3. 发送服务器证书</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    Note over C: 4. 验证证书有效性</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    C-&gt;&gt;S: 5. Pre-master secret &lt;br&gt; (用服务器公钥加密)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    Note over C,S: 6. 双方根据随机数&lt;br&gt;生成会话密钥</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    C-&gt;&gt;S: 7. Finished (加密后)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    S-&gt;&gt;C: 8. Finished (加密后)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    Note over C,S: 9. 后续通信使用对称加密</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>步骤详解</strong>：</p><ol><li><strong>Client Hello</strong>：客户端告知服务器自己支持的TLS版本、加密套件列表，并生成一个随机数。</li><li><strong>Server Hello</strong>：服务器选择双方都支持的TLS版本和加密套件，也生成一个随机数，连同自己的<strong>数字证书</strong>一同发回客户端。</li><li><strong>验证证书</strong>：客户端验证证书的签发机构是否受信任、证书是否在有效期内、域名是否匹配等。</li><li><strong>密钥交换</strong>：证书验证通过后，客户端生成另一个随机数（<code>Pre-Master Secret</code>），用服务器证书中的公钥加密后发送给服务器。</li><li><strong>生成会话密钥</strong>：服务器用私钥解密，获取<code>Pre-Master Secret</code>。此时，双方都拥有三个随机数，使用相同的算法生成最终的<strong>会话密钥</strong>（对称密钥）。</li><li><strong>加密通信</strong>：握手完成后，双方使用协商出的会话密钥对后续的HTTP通信进行对称加密和解密。</li></ol><h2 id="📜-3-证书类型与选择" tabindex="-1">📜 3 证书类型与选择 <a class="header-anchor" href="#📜-3-证书类型与选择" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;📜 3 证书类型与选择&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_3-1-验证级别分类" tabindex="-1">3.1 验证级别分类 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-验证级别分类" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 验证级别分类&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li><strong>域名验证型（DV）</strong>：仅验证申请者对域名的所有权。<strong>签发快速，成本低</strong>，适用于个人网站、博客。</li><li><strong>组织验证型（OV）</strong>：除域名外，还需验证申请企业的真实性。<strong>安全性更高</strong>，适用于企业官网。</li><li><strong>扩展验证型（EV）</strong>：最严格的验证，显示绿色公司栏，增强用户信任，但目前浏览器对其的视觉区分已减弱。</li></ul><h3 id="_3-2-免费与付费证书" tabindex="-1">3.2 免费与付费证书 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-免费与付费证书" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 免费与付费证书&quot;">​</a></h3><ul><li><strong>免费证书</strong>（如Let&#39;s Encrypt）：提供基础的DV证书验证，足够个人项目或测试环境使用。</li><li><strong>付费证书</strong>：通常提供OV或EV验证，并提供技术支持与赔付保障，适合商业和对安全要求高的场景。</li></ul><h2 id="🛠️-4-证书管理全流程" tabindex="-1">🛠️ 4 证书管理全流程 <a class="header-anchor" href="#🛠️-4-证书管理全流程" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;🛠️ 4 证书管理全流程&quot;">​</a></h2><p>证书管理覆盖了从申请到吊销的整个生命周期，核心环节如下：</p><div class="language-mermaid vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">mermaid</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">flowchart TD</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    A[申请证书] --&gt; B[安装部署]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    B --&gt; C[日常监控]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    C --&gt; D{证书是否快过期?}</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    D -- 是 --&gt; E[更新证书]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    E --&gt; B</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    D -- 否 --&gt; F[证书是否需吊销?]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    F -- 是 --&gt; G[安全吊销]</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">    F -- 否 --&gt; C</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="_4-1-获取证书-let-s-encrypt示例" tabindex="-1">4.1 获取证书：Let&#39;s Encrypt示例 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-1-获取证书-let-s-encrypt示例" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.1 获取证书：Let&#39;s Encrypt示例&quot;">​</a></h3><p>使用Certbot工具可以免费获取Let&#39;s Encrypt证书。</p><ol><li><strong>安装Certbot</strong>（以CentOS 7为例）：<div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> yum</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> install</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> snapd</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> systemctl</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> enable</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --now</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> snapd.socket</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> snap</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> install</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --classic</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certbot</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> ln</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> -s</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> /snap/bin/certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> /usr/bin/certbot</span></span></code></pre></div></li><li><strong>申请证书</strong>： <ul><li><strong>方式一（HTTP验证）</strong>：适用于80端口可访问。<div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certonly</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --nginx</span></span></code></pre></div></li><li><strong>方式二（DNS验证）</strong>：适用于80端口不可用。<div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certonly</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --manual</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --preferred-challenges</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> dns</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> -d</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> yourdomain.com</span></span></code></pre></div></li></ul></li><li><strong>证书文件</strong>：成功后，证书通常位于 <code>/etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/</code> 目录下，关键文件包括： <ul><li><code>fullchain.pem</code>：证书链文件（服务器证书+中间CA证书）</li><li><code>privkey.pem</code>：服务器私钥文件</li></ul></li></ol><h3 id="_4-2-安装部署-nginx配置示例" tabindex="-1">4.2 安装部署：Nginx配置示例 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-2-安装部署-nginx配置示例" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.2 安装部署：Nginx配置示例&quot;">​</a></h3><p>将证书部署到Nginx服务器上。</p><div class="language-nginx vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">nginx</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">server</span><span class="__shiki_140thh"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    listen </span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb">443</span><span class="__shiki_140thh"> ssl;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    server_name </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">yourdomain.com;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd">    # 指定证书和私钥的路径</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    ssl_certificate </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">/etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/fullchain.pem;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    ssl_certificate_key </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">/etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/privkey.pem;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd">    # 安全配置建议</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    ssl_protocols </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3; </span><span class="__shiki_21nrsd"># 启用现代协议</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    ssl_ciphers </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:...; </span><span class="__shiki_21nrsd"># 配置安全套件</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    ssl_prefer_server_ciphers </span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb">off</span><span class="__shiki_140thh">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd">    # 其他配置...</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd"># HTTP强制重定向到HTTPS</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">server</span><span class="__shiki_140thh"> {</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    listen </span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb">80</span><span class="__shiki_140thh">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    server_name </span><span class="__shiki_140thh">yourdomain.com;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1itgoe">    return</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> 301</span><span class="__shiki_140thh"> https://$server_name$request_uri;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_140thh">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>配置后，使用 <code>nginx -t</code> 测试配置语法，然后 <code>systemctl reload nginx</code> 重新加载配置。</p><h3 id="_4-3-维护与监控" tabindex="-1">4.3 维护与监控 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-3-维护与监控" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.3 维护与监控&quot;">​</a></h3><ol><li><strong>证书更新</strong>：Let&#39;s Encrypt证书有效期为90天，必须定期更新。 <ul><li><strong>测试续期</strong>：<code>sudo certbot renew --dry-run</code></li><li><strong>配置定时任务</strong>（如每月1日零点执行）：<div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">0</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> 0</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> 1</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> *</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> *</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> /usr/bin/certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> renew</span><span class="__shiki_140thh"> &amp;&amp; </span><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">/bin/nginx</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> -s</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> reload</span></span></code></pre></div></li></ul></li><li><strong>状态监控</strong>： <ul><li><strong>命令行检查有效期</strong>：<code>openssl x509 -in /path/to/certificate.crt -noout -dates</code></li><li><strong>在线工具</strong>：使用SSL Labs等在线服务检测网站SSL配置。</li></ul></li></ol><h3 id="_4-4-吊销与删除" tabindex="-1">4.4 吊销与删除 <a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-4-吊销与删除" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;4.4 吊销与删除&quot;">​</a></h3><p>当证书私钥泄露或不再需要时，应及时吊销。</p><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd"># 吊销证书</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> revoke</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --cert-path</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> /etc/letsencrypt/live/yourdomain.com/cert.pem</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_21nrsd"># 删除证书（清理配置文件）</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="__shiki_1t8gfj">sudo</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> certbot</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> delete</span><span class="__shiki_dzsirb"> --cert-name</span><span class="__shiki_mdbnqw"> yourdomain.com</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="⚠️-5-企业级应用与合规性" tabindex="-1">⚠️ 5 企业级应用与合规性 <a class="header-anchor" href="#⚠️-5-企业级应用与合规性" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;⚠️ 5 企业级应用与合规性&quot;">​</a></h2><p>在等保2.0等合规性要求中，对HTTPS和证书管理有明确规范。</p><ul><li><strong>通信传输安全</strong>：等保三级以上系统要求采用密码技术保证通信过程中数据的保密性和完整性。</li><li><strong>算法合规性</strong>：关键信息系统（如政务、金融）可能要求使用<strong>国密算法</strong>（SM2非对称加密、SM3哈希算法、SM4对称加密）。</li><li><strong>证书生命周期管理</strong>：企业需建立覆盖&quot;申请-部署-更新-撤销&quot;的全生命周期管控体系，避免证书过期导致服务中断。</li><li><strong>SSL卸载</strong>：为了减轻后端服务器负担，可在负载均衡器上终止SSL连接，由负载均衡器进行加解密，后端服务器处理明文请求。</li></ul><p>希望这份笔记能成为你学习路上的得力助手。如果你对某个具体环节（比如国密算法的具体配置）有更深入的兴趣，我们可以继续探讨。</p>`,36)])])}const g=a(t,[["render",p]]);export{d as __pageData,g as default};
